msgid "ISO 3382-1 quotes a just-noticeable difference for reverberation time of about {jnd_percent:g} % (clause not verified against the standard text). A change is not called significant from a single pair of positions."
msgstr "ISO 3382-1 给出的混响时间刚可察觉差约为 {jnd_percent:g} %（条款未对照标准原文核实）。仅凭一对位置不会把变化判定为显著。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "sample rates differ ({baseline_rate} Hz vs {candidate_rate} Hz); comparison is still allowed"
msgstr "采样率不同（{baseline_rate} Hz 对 {candidate_rate} Hz）；仍允许比较"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "sweep durations differ ({baseline_s} s vs {candidate_s} s)"
msgstr "扫频时长不同（{baseline_s} s 对 {candidate_s} s）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "sweep levels differ ({baseline_dbfs} dBFS vs {candidate_dbfs} dBFS)"
msgstr "扫频电平不同（{baseline_dbfs} dBFS 对 {candidate_dbfs} dBFS）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "one or both sides have no number"
msgstr "一方或双方没有数值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "candidate minus baseline (dB) on a shared log grid inside the common excitation band"
msgstr "候选减基线（dB），在共同激励频带内的同一对数频率网格上计算"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "early reflections are not compared unless both sides have high direct-sound confidence (baseline {baseline_confidence}, candidate {candidate_confidence})"
msgstr "只有两侧的直达声置信度都为高时才比较早期反射（基线 {baseline_confidence}，候选 {candidate_confidence}）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "frequency-response curves are missing on one or both sides (--no-curves)"
msgstr "一方或双方缺少频率响应曲线（--no-curves）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "one or both results have no excitation band, so they cannot be compared"
msgstr "一方或双方结果没有激励频带，因此无法比较"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the excitation bands do not overlap"
msgstr "两个结果的激励频带没有重叠"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "baseline {validity} ({reason})"
msgstr "基线：{validity}（{reason}）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "baseline {validity}"
msgstr "基线：{validity}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "candidate {validity} ({reason})"
msgstr "候选：{validity}（{reason}）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "candidate {validity}"
msgstr "候选：{validity}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "metrics are not both VALID"
msgstr "两侧指标并非都有效（VALID）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "placement lengths are not both VALID"
msgstr "两侧摆位长度并非都有效（VALID）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "common excitation band {low:g}-{high:g} Hz is {octaves:.2f} octaves, narrower than the required {required:g} octave"
msgstr "共同激励频带 {low:g}-{high:g} Hz 只有 {octaves:.2f} 个倍频程，窄于要求的 {required:g} 个倍频程"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "RT60 estimate missing on one or both sides (never taken from an invalid metric)"
msgstr "一方或双方缺少 RT60 估计值（RT60 估计值从不取自无效指标）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "band missing from the baseline"
msgstr "基线结果中没有该频带"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "path delay is compared only when both results used a compensated loopback"
msgstr "只有两个结果都使用了经过补偿的回送（loopback）时才比较路径延迟"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "band missing from the candidate"
msgstr "候选结果中没有该频带"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "ISO 3382-2:2008, 4.3.1, Table 1, read from the standard's preview pages (cdn.standards.iteh.ai sample of ISO 3382-2:2008) on 2026-09-24; footnotes not implemented"
msgstr "ISO 3382-2:2008，4.3.1，表 1，于 2026-09-24 从该标准的预览页（cdn.standards.iteh.ai 上的 ISO 3382-2:2008 样章）读取；脚注未实现"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Decay curves are never averaged; only VALID T values enter the mean."
msgstr "衰减曲线从不参与平均；只有有效（VALID）的 T 值计入平均值。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "ISO 3382-2 class {klass}: {n_source} source position(s), {n_mic} microphone position(s), {combos} source-microphone combination(s) against ISO 3382-2:2008, 4.3.1, Table 1, read from the standard's preview pages (cdn.standards.iteh.ai sample of ISO 3382-2:2008) on 2026-09-24; footnotes not implemented. The class is a label; the other clause 4 conditions (position spacing, distances from surfaces) are not checked."
msgstr "ISO 3382-2 等级 {klass}：{n_source} 个声源位置、{n_mic} 个话筒位置、{combos} 个声源-话筒组合，对照 ISO 3382-2:2008，4.3.1，表 1（于 2026-09-24 从该标准的预览页读取，即 cdn.standards.iteh.ai 上的 ISO 3382-2:2008 样章；脚注未实现）。该等级只是一个标签；第 4 条的其他条件（位置间距、与界面的距离）未作检查。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no VALID values to average"
msgstr "没有可平均的有效（VALID）值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Candidates only: a peak in the low-frequency response with a long narrow-band decay may be a room resonance, but room-mode identification is not attempted in v0.1."
msgstr "仅为候选：低频响应中窄带衰减较长的峰可能是房间共振，但 v0.1 不尝试识别房间模式。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the analysed response is {length_s:.2f} s long, so its resolution is {resolution_hz:.1f} Hz and peaks below {low:.0f} Hz cannot be separated"
msgstr "所分析的响应长 {length_s:.2f} s，因此分辨率为 {resolution_hz:.1f} Hz，低于 {low:.0f} Hz 的峰无法分开"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no part of the resonance range was excited and resolved; no search was made"
msgstr "共振搜索范围内没有既被激励又能分辨的部分；未进行搜索"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "frequency resolution is too coarse for the resonance search"
msgstr "频率分辨率太粗，无法进行共振搜索"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "some candidates have too few measurable neighbouring bands for the surroundings comparison; their decay is not called distinguishable"
msgstr "部分候选可测量的相邻频带太少，无法与周边频带比较；它们的衰减不判定为可区分"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the search is limited to {low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz, the part of the range whose 1/3-octave band lies inside the excited {band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz"
msgstr "搜索限于 {low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz，即 1/3 倍频程频带落在已激励的 {band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz 之内的那部分范围"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "candidates are envelope peaks standing above the local diffuse level; in a dense early tail some candidates may be statistical rather than discrete reflections"
msgstr "候选是高出局部扩散声级的包络峰；在密集的早期尾部，部分候选可能是统计起伏，而不是离散的反射"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the impulse response ends {analysed_ms:.1f} ms after the direct sound, so only that part of the {min_ms:.0f}-{max_ms:.0f} ms window could be searched"
msgstr "脉冲响应在直达声之后 {analysed_ms:.1f} ms 就结束了，因此 {min_ms:.0f}-{max_ms:.0f} ms 窗口中只有这一部分得到搜索"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "impulse response is too short after the direct sound for reflection analysis"
msgstr "直达声之后的脉冲响应太短，无法进行反射分析"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only the {count} strongest reflections are listed"
msgstr "只列出最强的 {count} 个反射"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct-sound detection confidence is low; reflection delays are relative to the strongest peak, which may not be the direct sound"
msgstr "直达声检测置信度低；反射延迟以最强峰为参照，而该峰可能不是直达声"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct sound (time 0 = the detected broadband direct sound)"
msgstr "直达声（时间 0 = 检测到的宽带直达声）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "dB re (full-scale sine RMS)^2 per Hz: the power spectral density is scaled so that 10*log10 of its integral is the reported AES17 RMS level in dBFS"
msgstr "dB re（满幅正弦 RMS）^2 每 Hz：功率谱密度经过缩放，使其积分的 10*log10 等于报告的 AES17 RMS 电平（dBFS）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "c = 331.3 * sqrt(1 + T/273.15) m/s (adiabatic ideal-gas relation for dry air; 343.2 m/s at 20 C, numerically equal to the ISO 9613-1 form c = 343.2 * sqrt(T/293.15))"
msgstr "c = 331.3 * sqrt(1 + T/273.15) m/s（干燥空气的绝热理想气体关系；20 C 时为 343.2 m/s，数值上与 ISO 9613-1 的形式 c = 343.2 * sqrt(T/293.15) 相同）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "No coordinate, room length, room width or wall distance is reported. One omnidirectional microphone at one position measures path lengths, not directions, and the deconvolved time origin contains the interface round-trip latency, so there is no absolute time of flight: the four independent arrival equations constrain six unknowns, a deficit of three without a tape-measured loudspeaker-to-microphone distance and two with it. The remaining freedom is the direction of the loudspeaker-to-microphone vector, and every direction reproduces the measured arrival times exactly. Only quantities invariant over that family are reported: the product of the two perpendicular distances to a plane, and the vertical axis once one perpendicular distance is supplied by the user."
msgstr "不报告任何坐标、房间长度、房间宽度或墙面距离。单个全指向话筒在一个位置上测得的是路径长度而不是方向，而且解卷积得到的时间原点包含音频接口的往返延迟，因此没有绝对传播时间：四个独立的到达方程约束六个未知量，没有用卷尺量出的扬声器到话筒距离时缺三个，有该距离时缺两个。剩下的自由度是扬声器到话筒矢量的方向，而每个方向都能精确重现测得的到达时间。只报告在这一族解上保持不变的量：到某个平面的两个垂直距离之积，以及在用户给出一个垂直距离之后的竖直方向。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "propagated from the stated tape-measure, temperature and peak-location uncertainties only; it excludes model error (that the reflector is flat, rigid and large compared with the wavelength, that the arrival is a first-order specular reflection, and that the user measured to the plane that actually reflected), which is usually larger"
msgstr "仅由所给的卷尺、温度和峰位置不确定度传播得出；不包括模型误差（反射面是否平整、刚性且远大于波长，该到达是否为一阶镜面反射，以及用户量的是否正是实际产生反射的那个平面），而模型误差通常更大"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "relative dB (0 dB = flat loopback of the reference sweep)"
msgstr "相对 dB（0 dB = 参考扫频的平直回送）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "uncalibrated: levels are dBFS, not dB SPL"
msgstr "未校准：电平为 dBFS，不是 dB SPL"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the sweep in the recording runs at {percent:.1f} % of the speed it was generated at: the DAW time-stretched it (Warp, Flex Time, Follow Tempo, elastic audio or a stretch mode). Switch time-stretching off for the sweep clip and measure again"
msgstr "录音中扫频的速度是生成时的 {percent:.1f} %：DAW 对它做了时间伸缩（Warp、Flex Time、Follow Tempo、弹性音频或某种伸缩模式）。请关闭扫频片段的时间伸缩，然后重新测量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the sweep in the recording runs at {percent:.1f} % of the speed it was generated at: a file generated at {generated_hz} Hz was played at {played_hz} Hz without sample-rate conversion (a DAW project at another sample rate that did not convert the file on import). Generate the sweep at the project's sample rate, or let the DAW convert it on import, and measure again"
msgstr "录音中扫频的速度是生成时的 {percent:.1f} %：以 {generated_hz} Hz 生成的文件未经采样率转换就以 {played_hz} Hz 播放（DAW 工程的采样率与文件不同，导入时没有转换该文件）。请按工程采样率生成扫频，或让 DAW 在导入时转换，然后重新测量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "all decay metrics are marked unreliable: {reason}"
msgstr "所有衰减指标都标记为不可靠：{reason}"

msgid "sweep settings"
msgstr "扫频设置"

msgid "estimated from reference audio"
msgstr "由参考音频估计"

msgid "declared by the user"
msgstr "用户声明"

msgid "survey"
msgstr "简易级"

msgid "engineering"
msgstr "工程级"

msgid "precision"
msgstr "精密级"

msgid "below survey"
msgstr "低于简易级"

msgid "unknown project command {command}"
msgstr "未知的项目命令 {command}"

msgid "at least one input channel is required"
msgstr "至少需要一个输入声道"

msgid "input channels are 1-based and must be >= 1"
msgstr "输入声道从 1 起编号，必须 >= 1"

msgid "each input channel may be listed once"
msgstr "每个输入声道只能列出一次"

msgid "the loopback channel is 1-based and must be >= 1"
msgstr "回送声道从 1 起编号，必须 >= 1"

msgid "input {channel} cannot be both the microphone and the loopback; record the loopback on a different input"
msgstr "输入 {channel} 不能同时用作话筒和回送；请把回送录到另一个输入上"

msgid "playback level must be <= 0 dBFS"
msgstr "播放电平必须 <= 0 dBFS"

msgid "signal is silent"
msgstr "信号为静音"

msgid "latency must be 'low' or 'high'"
msgstr "延迟必须是 'low' 或 'high'"

msgid "unknown audio backend {name}; available: portaudio, fake"
msgstr "未知的音频后端 {name}；可用：portaudio、fake"

msgid "sample rate {rate} Hz is not in {supported}"
msgstr "采样率 {rate} Hz 不在 {supported} 之中"

msgid "kind must be 'input' or 'output'"
msgstr "kind 必须是 'input' 或 'output'"

msgid "fake backend has no device {device}"
msgstr "模拟后端没有设备 {device}"

msgid "fake backend only has device 0"
msgstr "模拟后端只有设备 0"

msgid "channels are 1-based and must be >= 1"
msgstr "声道从 1 起编号，必须 >= 1"

msgid "measurement stopped"
msgstr "测量已停止"

msgid "playback/recording timed out"
msgstr "播放/录制超时"

msgid "playback/recording failed: {error}"
msgstr "播放/录制失败：{error}"

msgid "playback/recording failed in the audio callback: {error}"
msgstr "播放/录制在音频回调中失败：{error}"

msgid "the audio stream ended after {done} of {total} frames"
msgstr "音频流在 {total} 帧中只处理了 {done} 帧就结束了"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the audio device reported {count} buffer problem(s) during the take ({flags}); the recording may contain dropouts"
msgstr "音频设备在本次测量中报告了 {count} 次缓冲区问题（{flags}）；录音中可能有丢帧"

msgid "the audio backend (sounddevice / PortAudio) is not available; Standalone Mode needs it, Universal DAW Mode does not"
msgstr "音频后端（sounddevice / PortAudio）不可用；独立模式需要它，通用 DAW 模式不需要"

msgid "cannot query audio devices: {error}"
msgstr "无法查询音频设备：{error}"

msgid "input device {device} does not support {rate} Hz: {error}"
msgstr "输入设备 {device} 不支持 {rate} Hz：{error}"

msgid "output device {device} does not support {rate} Hz: {error}"
msgstr "输出设备 {device} 不支持 {rate} Hz：{error}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "WASAPI: shared mode goes through the Windows audio engine and accepts only the device's Default Format rate; exclusive mode (--wasapi-exclusive) bypasses the engine at a rate the hardware supports"
msgstr "WASAPI：共享模式经过 Windows 音频引擎，只接受设备“默认格式”的采样率；独占模式（--wasapi-exclusive）绕过音频引擎，以硬件支持的采样率运行"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "WDM kernel streaming: bypasses the Windows mixer; the device must support the rate"
msgstr "WDM 内核流（WDM-KS）：绕过 Windows 混音器；设备必须支持该采样率"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "ASIO: direct driver path (not included in RoomScope's desktop bundles)"
msgstr "ASIO：直接的驱动路径（RoomScope 桌面安装包未包含）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "DirectSound: deprecated, runs on the Windows audio engine; resamples and mixes, and PortAudio does not check its rates (all look accepted); prefer WASAPI"
msgstr "DirectSound：已弃用，运行在 Windows 音频引擎上；会重采样并混音，且 PortAudio 不检查它的采样率（看起来全部接受）；建议改用 WASAPI"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "MME: legacy path through the Windows audio engine; resamples and mixes, truncates device names; prefer WASAPI"
msgstr "MME：经过 Windows 音频引擎的旧式路径；会重采样并混音，并截断设备名称；建议改用 WASAPI"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Core Audio: the device runs at its nominal rate (Audio MIDI Setup) and PortAudio converts other rates, unless --coreaudio-set-rate sets the device rate and refuses to convert"
msgstr "Core Audio：设备以其标称采样率运行（“音频 MIDI 设置”），PortAudio 会转换其他采样率；使用 --coreaudio-set-rate 时则改为设置设备采样率并拒绝转换"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "ALSA: a hw: device is direct; default, pulse, pipewire, dmix and plug devices may resample"
msgstr "ALSA：hw: 设备是直接路径；default、pulse、pipewire、dmix 和 plug 设备可能重采样"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "JACK: runs at the JACK server's rate only"
msgstr "JACK：只能以 JACK 服务器的采样率运行"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "OSS: legacy Linux interface"
msgstr "OSS：旧式 Linux 接口"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "synthetic backend: nothing is played"
msgstr "合成后端：不会播放任何声音"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "shared-mode engine buffer default 10 ms; exclusive uses the device period"
msgstr "共享模式引擎缓冲默认 10 ms；独占模式使用设备周期"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "WaveRT compiled defaults 10 / 40 ms (WaveCyclic 10 / 85 ms)"
msgstr "WaveRT 编译默认值 10 / 40 ms（WaveCyclic 为 10 / 85 ms）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "preferred / maximum driver buffer"
msgstr "首选 / 最大驱动缓冲"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "PortAudio compiled defaults 120 / 240 ms"
msgstr "PortAudio 编译默认值 120 / 240 ms"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "PortAudio compiled defaults 90 / 180 ms"
msgstr "PortAudio 编译默认值 90 / 180 ms"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "fallback 10 / 100 ms when the device latency is unreadable"
msgstr "设备延迟不可读时回退为 10 / 100 ms"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "compiled default (512-128)/fs / (2048-512)/fs: 8 / 32 ms at 48 kHz if hardware allows"
msgstr "编译默认值 (512-128)/fs / (2048-512)/fs：硬件允许时在 48 kHz 下为 8 / 32 ms"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "port latency divided by the JACK server rate"
msgstr "端口延迟除以 JACK 服务器采样率"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "not assessed"
msgstr "未评估"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "requested 4 fragments × 128 frames; low=(nfrags-1)*frag/fs (8 / 32 ms at 48 kHz if the driver keeps those sizes)"
msgstr "请求 4 个片段 × 每片段 128 帧；低延迟=(nfrags-1)*frag/fs（若驱动保持该大小，48 kHz 下为 8 / 32 ms）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "PortAudio host-API name on a given OS"
msgstr "给定操作系统上的 PortAudio 主机 API 名称"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "measured round-trip latency"
msgstr "测得的往返延迟"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "whether Windows/Core Audio expose loopback as extra channels"
msgstr "Windows/Core Audio 是否把回送显示为额外声道"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "analogue line-output count"
msgstr "模拟线路输出数量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "PortAudio channel count including ADAT at each rate"
msgstr "各采样率下含 ADAT 的 PortAudio 声道数"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "discrete sample-rate list (only a 28–200 kHz range is stated)"
msgstr "离散采样率列表（来源只给出 28–200 kHz 范围）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "This machine's PortAudio device list (ALSA 0 devices, OSS 0 devices): no physical interface"
msgstr "本机 PortAudio 设备列表（ALSA 0 个设备，OSS 0 个设备）：没有实体接口"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Measured full-duplex round-trip latency on any interface"
msgstr "任何接口上测得的全双工往返延迟"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Pa_IsFormatSupported results on a physical interface (sample-rate negotiation)"
msgstr "实体接口上的 Pa_IsFormatSupported 结果（采样率协商）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "ASIO compiled numeric default latency (PortAudio stores the driver's buffer only)"
msgstr "ASIO 的编译默认数值延迟（PortAudio 只保存驱动缓冲）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "JACK compiled numeric default latency (only jack_port_get_latency / server rate)"
msgstr "JACK 的编译默认数值延迟（只有 jack_port_get_latency / 服务器采样率）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Core Audio device-specific latency (only the 10 / 100 ms fallback is sourced)"
msgstr "Core Audio 设备特定延迟（只有 10 / 100 ms 回退值有来源）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Scarlett 18i20 4th Gen analogue line-output count (spec page did not yield a clear figure)"
msgstr "Scarlett 18i20 第四代模拟线路输出数量（规格页未给出明确数字）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "USB Audio Class 1.0 / 2.0 discrete rate tables (USB-IF PDFs were not re-read)"
msgstr "USB Audio Class 1.0 / 2.0 离散采样率表（未重读 USB-IF PDF）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Hardware bit depth of a PortAudio stream (RoomScope writes 32-bit float; manufacturer pages above state 24-bit converters)"
msgstr "PortAudio 流的硬件位深度（RoomScope 写出 32-bit float；上述厂商页面写的是 24-bit 转换器）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "ALSA plugin or sound-server device: may resample and mix"
msgstr "ALSA 插件或声音服务器设备：可能重采样并混音"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "accepts none of RoomScope's sample rates for recording"
msgstr "录制时不接受 RoomScope 的任何采样率"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "accepts none of RoomScope's sample rates for playback"
msgstr "播放时不接受 RoomScope 的任何采样率"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no audio device found; Universal DAW Mode still works"
msgstr "未找到音频设备；通用 DAW 模式仍然可用"

msgid "playback ({output}) and recording ({input}) use different devices, which run on separate sample clocks; their drift smears the measurement. Use one interface for both, or an aggregate device with drift correction (macOS), and check the result with a loopback"
msgstr "播放（{output}）和录制（{input}）使用不同的设备，它们各自运行在独立的采样时钟上，时钟漂移会抹平测量结果。请用同一个音频接口完成播放和录制，或使用带漂移校正的聚合设备（macOS），并用回送检查结果"

msgid "input channel {channel} does not exist on {device} ({count} input channel(s))"
msgstr "{device} 上没有输入声道 {channel}（共 {count} 个输入声道）"

msgid "output channel {channel} does not exist on {device} ({count} output channel(s))"
msgstr "{device} 上没有输出声道 {channel}（共 {count} 个输出声道）"

msgid "there is no audio device {index}"
msgstr "没有音频设备 {index}"

msgid "input {input} ({input_api}) and output {output} ({output_api}) belong to different host APIs; PortAudio records and plays in one stream only within one host API. Choose both on the same host API"
msgstr "输入 {input}（{input_api}）和输出 {output}（{output_api}）属于不同的主机 API；PortAudio 只能在同一个主机 API 内用一个流同时录制和播放。请在同一个主机 API 上选择输入和输出"

msgid "{api} has no default input device; choose the input device on {api} as well"
msgstr "{api} 没有默认输入设备；请同样在 {api} 上选择输入设备"

msgid "{api} has no default output device; choose the output device on {api} as well"
msgstr "{api} 没有默认输出设备；请同样在 {api} 上选择输出设备"

msgid "WASAPI exclusive mode was requested, but {device} is a {api} device; choose a Windows WASAPI device or drop --wasapi-exclusive"
msgstr "已请求 WASAPI 独占模式，但 {device} 是 {api} 设备；请选择 Windows WASAPI 设备，或去掉 --wasapi-exclusive"

msgid "setting the Core Audio device rate was requested, but {device} is a {api} device; drop --coreaudio-set-rate"
msgstr "已请求设置 Core Audio 设备的采样率，但 {device} 是 {api} 设备；请去掉 --coreaudio-set-rate"

msgid "sample_rate must be positive"
msgstr "sample_rate 必须为正数"

msgid "samples must be 1-D (mono) or 2-D (frames, channels)"
msgstr "samples 必须是一维（单声道）或二维（帧, 声道）数组"

msgid "signal is empty"
msgstr "信号为空"

msgid "signal contains NaN or infinite samples"
msgstr "信号包含 NaN 或无穷大的采样"

msgid "channel {index} does not exist (signal has {count} channel(s))"
msgstr "声道 {index} 不存在（信号共有 {count} 个声道）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "recording has {count} channels; channel {chosen} (highest RMS) was analysed. Use the channel setting to choose explicitly."
msgstr "录音有 {count} 个声道；已分析声道 {chosen}（RMS 最高）。可用声道设置明确指定。"

msgid "sample_rate must be a positive integer"
msgstr "sample_rate 必须是正整数"

msgid "sample_rate {rate} is not supported; use one of {supported}"
msgstr "不支持 sample_rate {rate}；请使用以下之一：{supported}"

msgid "duration_s must be >= 0.5 s"
msgstr "duration_s 必须 >= 0.5 s"

msgid "duration_s must be <= 120 s"
msgstr "duration_s 必须 <= 120 s"

msgid "start_hz must be > 0"
msgstr "start_hz 必须 > 0"

msgid "end_hz must be greater than start_hz"
msgstr "end_hz 必须大于 start_hz"

msgid "end_hz must not exceed the Nyquist frequency"
msgstr "end_hz 不能超过奈奎斯特频率"

msgid "fades must be >= 0"
msgstr "淡入淡出时长必须 >= 0"

msgid "fades must be shorter than the sweep"
msgstr "淡入淡出必须短于扫频"

msgid "level_dbfs must be <= 0 dBFS"
msgstr "level_dbfs 必须 <= 0 dBFS"

msgid "level_dbfs below -80 dBFS is not a usable test signal"
msgstr "level_dbfs 低于 -80 dBFS 时不是可用的测试信号"

msgid "silences must be >= 0"
msgstr "静音时长必须 >= 0"

msgid "channel must be >= 0 or None"
msgstr "channel 必须 >= 0 或为 None"

msgid "ir_pre_delay_ms must be >= 0"
msgstr "ir_pre_delay_ms 必须 >= 0"

msgid "ir_max_length_s must be > 0.1 s"
msgstr "ir_max_length_s 必须 > 0.1 s"

msgid "at least one octave band is required"
msgstr "至少需要一个倍频程频带"

msgid "octave band frequencies must be > 0"
msgstr "倍频程频带的频率必须 > 0"

msgid "octave_bands_hz must be ascending"
msgstr "octave_bands_hz 必须按升序排列"

msgid "fr_window_s must be > 0"
msgstr "fr_window_s 必须 > 0"

msgid "fr_smoothing_fraction must be >= 0"
msgstr "fr_smoothing_fraction 必须 >= 0"

msgid "noise_min_segment_s must be > 0"
msgstr "noise_min_segment_s 必须 > 0"

msgid "reflection delay window is invalid"
msgstr "反射延迟窗口无效"

msgid "reflections_threshold_db must be negative"
msgstr "reflections_threshold_db 必须为负数"

msgid "reflections_prominence_db must be > 0"
msgstr "reflections_prominence_db 必须 > 0"

msgid "resonance_max_hz must be > 20 Hz"
msgstr "resonance_max_hz 必须 > 20 Hz"

msgid "resonance_min_prominence_db must be > 0"
msgstr "resonance_min_prominence_db 必须 > 0"

msgid "decay_noise_margin_db must be >= 0"
msgstr "decay_noise_margin_db 必须 >= 0"

msgid "placement_distance_m must be between 0.20 m and 15 m"
msgstr "placement_distance_m 必须在 0.20 m 到 15 m 之间"

msgid "placement_mic_height_m must be between 0.02 m and 5 m"
msgstr "placement_mic_height_m 必须在 0.02 m 到 5 m 之间"

msgid "placement_temperature_c must be between -20 C and 50 C"
msgstr "placement_temperature_c 必须在 -20 °C 到 50 °C 之间"

msgid "placement_mic_height_m needs placement_distance_m: a height on its own cannot be turned into geometry"
msgstr "placement_mic_height_m 需要同时给出 placement_distance_m：仅有高度无法换算成几何位置"

msgid "loopback_channel must be >= 0 or None"
msgstr "loopback_channel 必须 >= 0 或为 None"

