msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "reference sweep regenerated at the recording sample rate ({sample_rate} Hz); it was defined at {defined_rate} Hz"
msgstr "参考扫频已按录音采样率（{sample_rate} Hz）重新生成；它原本定义为 {defined_rate} Hz"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "reference signal resampled from {from_rate} Hz to {to_rate} Hz"
msgstr "参考信号已从 {from_rate} Hz 重采样到 {to_rate} Hz"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the reference audio starts with {lead_s:.2f} s and ends with {tail_s:.2f} s of near-silence (below {threshold_db:g} dB re its peak); it was removed so that the reference is the sweep itself, and sweep positions refer to the sweep, not to the start of the file"
msgstr "参考音频开头有 {lead_s:.2f} s、结尾有 {tail_s:.2f} s 近乎静音（低于其峰值 {threshold_db:g} dB）；这些部分已去除，使参考只包含扫频本身，扫频位置均相对于扫频起点，而非文件开头"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "reference given as an audio file without a RoomScope sweep definition; using regularised spectral division instead of the analytic inverse filter, and the excitation band is estimated from the reference spectrum"
msgstr "参考以音频文件形式提供，没有 RoomScope 扫频定义；因此改用正则化频谱除法代替解析逆滤波器，激励频带由参考信号的频谱估计得出"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the reference covers about {low_hz:.0f}-{high_hz:.0f} Hz (-3 dB); the outer 1/3 octave at each end is used for the regularisation roll-off and excluded"
msgstr "参考信号约覆盖 {low_hz:.0f}-{high_hz:.0f} Hz（-3 dB）；两端各 1/3 倍频程用于正则化滚降，不计入分析"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the recording starts {missing_ms:.0f} ms after the sweep began; the excitation band now starts at {new_low_hz:.0f} Hz instead of {old_low_hz:.0f} Hz"
msgstr "录音在扫频开始后 {missing_ms:.0f} ms 才开始；激励频带下限因此从 {old_low_hz:.0f} Hz 改为 {new_low_hz:.0f} Hz"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "recording is silent (peak below {threshold_dbfs:g} dBFS); check the input routing and, on macOS, that the app has microphone access (System Settings > Privacy & Security > Microphone)"
msgstr "录音无声（峰值低于 {threshold_dbfs:g} dBFS）；请检查输入路由；在 macOS 上还请确认本应用已获得麦克风权限（系统设置 > 隐私与安全性 > 麦克风）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "recording has {runs} flat-topped peaks ({samples} samples) at {peak_dbfs:.1f} dBFS, its highest level: probable clipping before an export or a gain change, because the flat tops are below full scale; lower the playback or input level and measure again"
msgstr "录音在其最高电平 {peak_dbfs:.1f} dBFS 处有 {runs} 个平顶峰（共 {samples} 个采样）：平顶低于满刻度，说明很可能在导出或增益调整之前就已削波；请降低播放或输入电平后重测"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "recording has {runs} flat-topped peaks ({samples} samples) at {peak_dbfs:.1f} dBFS, its highest level: probable clipping; lower the playback or input level and measure again"
msgstr "录音在其最高电平 {peak_dbfs:.1f} dBFS 处有 {runs} 个平顶峰（共 {samples} 个采样）：很可能已削波；请降低播放或输入电平后重测"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "recording is shorter than one second"
msgstr "录音短于 1 秒"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the sweep was played at {speed_percent:.1f} % of the speed it was generated at, so the deconvolved response is not the room's impulse response"
msgstr "扫频以生成时速度的 {speed_percent:.1f} % 播放，因此解卷积得到的响应不是房间的脉冲响应"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct-sound detection confidence is low (pre-peak margin not checkable): the recording may not contain the reference sweep"
msgstr "直达声检测置信度低（峰前余量无法检查）：录音中可能不含该参考扫频"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct-sound detection confidence is low (pre-peak margin {margin_db:.1f} dB): the recording may not contain the reference sweep"
msgstr "直达声检测置信度低（峰前余量 {margin_db:.1f} dB）：录音中可能不含该参考扫频"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the recording clips, so the measurement chain was not linear and the deconvolved response is not the room's impulse response"
msgstr "录音削波，测量链路并非线性，因此解卷积得到的响应不是房间的脉冲响应"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "aliased distortion (folded harmonic {orders} at {level_db:.0f} dB re the direct sound) spreads over the impulse response after the direct sound and imitates a decay"
msgstr "混叠失真（折叠回来的 {orders} 次谐波，相对直达声 {level_db:.0f} dB）散布在直达声之后的脉冲响应中，看起来像衰减"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "recording has {count} channels; channel {channel} (highest RMS excluding loopback channel {loopback_channel}) was analysed"
msgstr "录音有 {count} 个声道；已分析声道 {channel}（除回送声道 {loopback_channel} 外 RMS 最高）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the tape-measured loudspeaker distance ({distance_m:.2f} m) exceeds the loopback path-delay bound ({bound_m:.2f} m); the tape cannot be longer than what sound had time to travel"
msgstr "卷尺测得的扬声器距离（{distance_m:.2f} m）超过了由回送路径延迟得出的上限（{bound_m:.2f} m）；卷尺量得的距离不可能比声音实际传播的距离更长"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "loopback compensation applied: the frequency response is relative to the interface return"
msgstr "已应用回送补偿：频率响应以音频接口的回送信号为参考"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the recording contains {passes} sweep passes (pulses within {pass_level_db:g} dB of the strongest); pass {order}, starting at {start_s:.2f} s, was analysed and the others were ignored. Record a single pass for a clean measurement"
msgstr "录音中包含 {passes} 遍扫频（与最强脉冲相差不超过 {pass_level_db:g} dB 的脉冲）；已分析从 {start_s:.2f} s 开始的第 {order} 遍，其余均被忽略。只录一遍扫频才能得到干净的测量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the impulse response ends where the next sweep pass starts ({length_s:.2f} s after the direct sound)"
msgstr "脉冲响应在下一遍扫频开始处截止（直达声之后 {length_s:.2f} s）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only {length_s:.2f} s of decay were recorded after the sweep; long reverberation times cannot be evaluated"
msgstr "扫频之后只录到 {length_s:.2f} s 的衰减；无法评估较长的混响时间"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "there is no content before the direct sound to check the detection against; direct-sound detection confidence is low"
msgstr "直达声之前没有可用于核对检测结果的内容；直达声检测置信度低"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "content before the direct sound is only {margin_db:.1f} dB below it (noise, pre-ringing or a wrong reference); direct-sound detection confidence is medium"
msgstr "直达声之前的内容仅比直达声低 {margin_db:.1f} dB（噪声、预振铃或参考信号不对）；直达声检测置信度中等"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "content before the direct sound is only {margin_db:.1f} dB below it (noise, pre-ringing or a wrong reference); direct-sound detection confidence is low"
msgstr "直达声之前的内容仅比直达声低 {margin_db:.1f} dB（噪声、预振铃或参考信号不对）；直达声检测置信度低"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "harmonic {orders} of the sweep was folded back below the Nyquist frequency ({level_db:.0f} dB re the direct sound): a nonlinearity in the digital domain (a playback bus or export that clipped, or a saturation plug-in without oversampling) distorted the signal before the converter. The folded products land after the direct sound and imitate a long decay, so the decay metrics cannot be trusted. Lower the level in the playback path and measure again"
msgstr "扫频的 {orders} 次谐波被折叠回奈奎斯特频率以下（相对直达声 {level_db:.0f} dB）：数字域中的非线性（播放总线或导出发生削波，或未开过采样的饱和插件）在转换器之前就让信号失真了。折叠产物落在直达声之后，看起来像很长的衰减，因此衰减指标不可信。请降低播放链路中的电平后重测"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the frequency response is gated to {window_ms:.0f} ms after the direct sound, so its resolution is {resolution_hz:.1f} Hz; the resonance search uses the ungated response"
msgstr "频率响应被门控为直达声之后 {window_ms:.0f} ms，因此分辨率为 {resolution_hz:.1f} Hz；共振搜索使用未门控的响应"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "impulse response imported; deconvolution, sweep-position checks and distortion indicators were skipped"
msgstr "已导入脉冲响应；跳过了解卷积、扫频位置检查和失真指标"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "excitation band was not declared; band metrics are not computed"
msgstr "未声明激励频带；不计算频带指标"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "excitation band unknown (imported impulse response; declare --band)"
msgstr "激励频带未知（导入的脉冲响应；请用 --band 声明）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no recording segment exists (imported impulse response)"
msgstr "没有录音片段（导入的脉冲响应）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "recording is shorter than the reference sweep; the file does not contain the full sweep"
msgstr "录音比参考扫频短；该文件没有包含完整的扫频"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "deconvolved signal is empty"
msgstr "解卷积后的信号为空"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "deconvolved signal has no usable peak (silent recording?)"
msgstr "解卷积后的信号没有可用的峰值（录音是否无声？）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the next sweep pass starts right after this one; the room decay after the sweep was not recorded. Leave silence after each sweep (the generated test file contains it) or record a single pass"
msgstr "下一遍扫频紧接着这一遍开始，扫频之后的房间衰减没有录到。请在每遍扫频之后留出静音（生成的测试文件已包含），或只录一遍"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the direct sound was found at the very end of the recording; the recording does not contain the room decay after the sweep"
msgstr "直达声出现在录音的最末尾；录音中没有扫频之后的房间衰减"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the harmonic lies above the excitation band"
msgstr "该谐波位于激励频带之上"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the harmonic window lies outside the deconvolved signal"
msgstr "谐波窗口超出了解卷积后信号的范围"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the harmonic window is too short to resolve the common band"
msgstr "谐波窗口太短，无法分辨共同频带"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the linear response has no energy in the common band"
msgstr "线性响应在共同频带内没有能量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no harmonic-free content before the direct sound to compare with"
msgstr "直达声之前没有不含谐波的内容可供比较"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "not distinguishable from the floor (at most {level_db:.1f} dB, floor {floor_db:.1f} dB)"
msgstr "与本底无法区分（至多 {level_db:.1f} dB，本底 {floor_db:.1f} dB）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "harmonic {order} folds back to {low_khz:.1f}-{high_khz:.1f} kHz, outside the swept range, where the inverse filter has no gain: such products cannot reach the impulse response"
msgstr "{order} 次谐波折叠到 {low_khz:.1f}-{high_khz:.1f} kHz，位于扫频范围之外，逆滤波器在那里没有增益：这类产物不会进入脉冲响应"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no wide enough part of the folded trajectory of harmonic {order} can be separated from the sweep and its non-aliased harmonics"
msgstr "{order} 次谐波的折叠轨迹中，没有足够宽的一段能与扫频本身及其未混叠的谐波分开"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "harmonic {order} of this sweep does not fold back into the swept range at {sample_rate} Hz"
msgstr "在 {sample_rate} Hz 下，此扫频的 {order} 次谐波不会折叠回扫频范围内"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the probe window lies outside the recording"
msgstr "探测窗口超出了录音范围"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the linear response has no energy in the probe band"
msgstr "线性响应在探测频带内没有能量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no content before the probe window to compare with"
msgstr "探测窗口之前没有可供比较的内容"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "relative dB (0 dB = the interface loopback)"
msgstr "相对 dB（0 dB = 音频接口回送）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the loopback channel clips; compensation is not applied"
msgstr "回送声道削波；未应用补偿"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the loopback peak does not stand far enough above the content before it (confidence medium); the channel may be a microphone, not an electrical return. Compensation is not applied"
msgstr "回送峰值没有明显高出其之前的内容（置信度中等）；该声道可能是话筒，而不是电信号回送。未应用补偿"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the loopback peak does not stand far enough above the content before it (confidence low); the channel may be a microphone, not an electrical return. Compensation is not applied"
msgstr "回送峰值没有明显高出其之前的内容（置信度低）；该声道可能是话筒，而不是电信号回送。未应用补偿"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the loopback recording is too short after the peak to check that the return is electrical; compensation is not applied"
msgstr "回送录音在峰值之后太短，无法确认回送是电信号；未应用补偿"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the loopback still carries energy {settle_ms:.1f} ms after the peak (late peak {drop_db:.1f} dB down); that looks like a room, not a cable. Compensation is not applied"
msgstr "回送在峰值之后 {settle_ms:.1f} ms 仍有能量（后续峰值仅低 {drop_db:.1f} dB）；这更像房间而不是线缆。未应用补偿"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "loopback settled in {settle_ms:.1f} ms (late peak {drop_db:.1f} dB down); using a {fir_samples}-sample interface FIR around the peak"
msgstr "回送在 {settle_ms:.1f} ms 内稳定（后续峰值低 {drop_db:.1f} dB）；使用峰值附近 {fir_samples} 个采样的音频接口 FIR"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the microphone peak precedes the loopback peak by {lead_ms:.2f} ms; the path-delay bound is not reported"
msgstr "话筒峰值比回送峰值早 {lead_ms:.2f} ms；不报告路径延迟上限"

msgid "recording is at {sample_rate} Hz but the sweep cannot be regenerated at that rate: {error}"
msgstr "录音采样率为 {sample_rate} Hz，但扫频无法按该采样率重新生成：{error}"

msgid "reference signal cannot be used: {error}"
msgstr "参考信号无法使用：{error}"

msgid "the recording starts about {missing_s:.2f} s after the sweep began, so frequencies below about {lost_hz:.0f} Hz were not recorded. Start the recording before playback (the test file begins with silence for this purpose) and export the whole take"
msgstr "录音在扫频开始约 {missing_s:.2f} s 后才开始，因此约 {lost_hz:.0f} Hz 以下的频率没有录到。请在播放前开始录音（测试文件开头的静音正是为此准备的），并导出完整的一次录音"

msgid "the recording starts about {missing_s:.2f} s after the reference sweep began, so the first part of the sweep (for a rising sweep: its lowest frequencies) was not recorded. Start the recording before playback and export the whole take"
msgstr "录音在参考扫频开始约 {missing_s:.2f} s 后才开始，因此扫频的开头部分（对上升扫频而言即最低的频率）没有录到。请在播放前开始录音，并导出完整的一次录音"

msgid "the recording starts after the swept range; no part of the sweep can be analysed"
msgstr "录音在扫频范围结束之后才开始；扫频的任何部分都无法分析"

msgid "the loopback file and the recording have different sample rates; export both from the same take"
msgstr "回送文件与录音的采样率不同；请从同一次录音中导出两者"

msgid "loopback_channel {channel} does not exist (recording has {count} channel(s))"
msgstr "loopback_channel {channel} 不存在（录音只有 {count} 个声道）"

msgid "loopback_channel must differ from the microphone channel"
msgstr "loopback_channel 必须与话筒声道不同"

msgid "the loopback file and the recording differ in length by more than {tolerance_ms:.0f} ms; export both from the same take"
msgstr "回送文件与录音的长度相差超过 {tolerance_ms:.0f} ms；请从同一次录音中导出两者"

msgid "impulse response is shorter than 50 ms"
msgstr "脉冲响应短于 50 ms"

msgid "excitation_band must be a (low_hz, high_hz) pair with high > low > 0"
msgstr "excitation_band 必须是 (low_hz, high_hz) 数对，且 high > low > 0"

msgid "this file cannot be analysed as an impulse response: its strongest sample is only {margin_db:.1f} dB above the content before it (at least {required_db:g} dB is required). It may be a recording (a recording of the test sweep is analysed with `roomscope analyze`), or an IR whose direct sound is weaker than a later arrival, which RoomScope cannot use as time zero. For a band-limited IR, declare its band with --band"
msgstr "该文件无法作为脉冲响应分析：其最强采样只比之前的内容高 {margin_db:.1f} dB（至少需要 {required_db:g} dB）。它可能是一段录音（测试扫频的录音请用 `roomscope analyze` 分析），也可能是直达声弱于后到声音的脉冲响应，RoomScope 无法把它用作时间零点。对于带限脉冲响应，请用 --band 声明其频带"

msgid "the frequency-response window ({window_ms:.1f} ms) is shorter than its {taper_ms:g} ms end taper plus {minimum_ms:g} ms: it would attenuate or exclude the direct sound. Use a longer window"
msgstr "频率响应窗口（{window_ms:.1f} ms）短于其 {taper_ms:g} ms 末端渐变加 {minimum_ms:g} ms：这会衰减或排除直达声。请使用更长的窗口"

msgid "reference signal must be a non-empty mono array"
msgstr "参考信号必须是非空的单声道数组"

msgid "reference signal is silent"
msgstr "参考信号无声"

msgid "reference signal must be a mono array with at least 16 samples"
msgstr "参考信号必须是至少含 16 个采样的单声道数组"

msgid "reference signal contains NaN or infinite samples"
msgstr "参考信号包含 NaN 或无穷大采样"

msgid "the reference signal only covers {low_hz:.0f}-{high_hz:.0f} Hz; that is too narrow for a sweep measurement"
msgstr "参考信号只覆盖 {low_hz:.0f}-{high_hz:.0f} Hz；对扫频测量来说太窄了"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no detected reflection can be read as coming from the horizontal plane the microphone height was measured from: {rejections}"
msgstr "检测到的反射均无法解读为来自测量话筒高度所依据的水平面：{rejections}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no detected reflection can be read as coming from the horizontal plane the microphone height was measured from; none was detected at all"
msgstr "没有反射可解读为来自测量话筒高度所依据的水平面；根本没有检测到任何反射"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the plane the heights are measured from was not established, so nothing above it can be placed"
msgstr "未能确定测量高度所依据的平面，因此无法确定其上方任何表面的位置"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only the two horizontal planes are ever named. No wall is identified: one omnidirectional microphone gives no bearing, so naming one would be a guess"
msgstr "只会标注两个水平面，不识别任何墙面：单只全指向话筒无法提供方位信息，指认墙面只能是猜测"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "reads {excess:.1f} dB above what a lossless point source mirrored in a rigid plane would give at that path length, so it is not treated as a first-order specular arrival (it may be two arrivals merged by the envelope peak-hold, a comb-filter artefact or a peak of the dense early tail)"
msgstr "读数比无损点声源经刚性平面镜像后在该路径长度上应有的值高 {excess:.1f} dB，因此不视为一阶镜面反射到达（可能是被包络峰值保持合并的两次到达、梳状滤波伪影，或密集早期尾部中的一个峰）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate reads {excess:.1f} dB above what a lossless point source mirrored in a rigid plane would give at that path length, so it is not treated as a first-order specular arrival (it may be two arrivals merged by the envelope peak-hold, a comb-filter artefact or a peak of the dense early tail)"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射读数比无损点声源经刚性平面镜像后在该路径长度上应有的值高 {excess:.1f} dB，因此不视为一阶镜面反射到达（可能是被包络峰值保持合并的两次到达、梳状滤波伪影，或密集早期尾部中的一个峰）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "reads {attenuation:.1f} dB below that ceiling, more than the {limit:.0f} dB RoomScope treats as the limit for a discrete plane reflection, so it is not used to attribute a surface"
msgstr "读数比该上限低 {attenuation:.1f} dB，超过了 RoomScope 视为离散平面反射极限的 {limit:.0f} dB，因此不用于判定反射面"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate reads {attenuation:.1f} dB below that ceiling, more than the {limit:.0f} dB RoomScope treats as the limit for a discrete plane reflection, so it is not used to attribute a surface"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射读数比该上限低 {attenuation:.1f} dB，超过了 RoomScope 视为离散平面反射极限的 {limit:.0f} dB，因此不用于判定反射面"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the reflection search was cut short at {end:.1f} ms, and truncation does not drop arrivals at random: it drops the longest paths first, so any height derived from what remains is biased low"
msgstr "反射搜索在 {end:.1f} ms 处被截断，而截断并不是随机丢弃到达声：它最先丢弃路径最长的反射，因此由剩余反射推算的任何高度都会偏低"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no air temperature was supplied, so {temperature:.0f} C ({speed:.1f} m/s) was assumed; a 5 C error moves every distance by about 0.9 %"
msgstr "未提供气温，因此假定为 {temperature:.0f} C（声速 {speed:.1f} m/s）；气温误差 5 C 会使每个距离偏差约 0.9 %"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct-sound detection confidence is low, so the time origin every delay is measured from was not established and no distance derived from it is reported"
msgstr "直达声检测置信度为低，因此未能确立所有延迟的计时起点，不报告由此推算的任何距离"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no detected reflection can be read as a plane above both devices: {rejections}; even the lowest plausible upper plane ({lowest:.1f} m) would arrive at about {delay:.1f} ms, beyond the {start:.1f}-{end:.1f} ms window that could be searched, so absence here is not evidence of absence"
msgstr "检测到的反射均无法解读为位于两台设备上方的平面：{rejections}；即使是最低的合理上方平面（{lowest:.1f} m），其反射也约在 {delay:.1f} ms 才到达，超出了可搜索的 {start:.1f}-{end:.1f} ms 窗口，因此此处没有找到并不代表不存在"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "more than one reflection could be the surface the height was measured from, and they disagree by more than {agreement_cm:.0f} cm: {values}. RoomScope does not choose between them. This is the expected outcome when the microphone sits near the vertical midpoint of the room, where the arrival from the surface below and the one from the surface above are interchangeable; moving the microphone 20-30 cm up or down and measuring again separates them"
msgstr "有不止一个反射可能来自测量高度所依据的表面，且它们之间相差超过 {agreement_cm:.0f} cm：{values}。RoomScope 不会在其中做选择。话筒位于房间垂直方向中点附近时这是预期结果，因为来自下方表面和上方表面的到达声可以互换；将话筒上移或下移 20-30 cm 后重新测量即可将两者分开"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "inherited from the reflection search: {note}"
msgstr "沿用自反射搜索：{note}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct-sound detection confidence is medium, so the time origin every delay is measured from was not established and no distance derived from it is reported"
msgstr "直达声检测置信度为中，因此未能确立所有延迟的计时起点，不报告由此推算的任何距离"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "direct-sound detection confidence is {confidence}, so the time origin every delay is measured from was not established and no distance derived from it is reported"
msgstr "直达声检测置信度为 {confidence}，因此未能确立所有延迟的计时起点，不报告由此推算的任何距离"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no loudspeaker-to-microphone distance was supplied; measure the straight line from the loudspeaker to the microphone capsule with a tape"
msgstr "未提供扬声器到话筒的距离；请用卷尺测量扬声器到话筒振膜的直线距离"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no microphone height was supplied, so no reflection can be attributed to a horizontal plane"
msgstr "未提供话筒高度，因此无法将任何反射归属到水平面"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate implies a loudspeaker {height:.2f} m above the plane the height was measured from ({low:.2f}-{high:.2f} m is treated as plausible)"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射意味着扬声器位于测量高度所依据平面上方 {height:.2f} m 处（合理范围为 {low:.2f}-{high:.2f} m）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no detected reflection can be read as a plane above both devices: {rejections}"
msgstr "检测到的反射均无法解读为位于两台设备上方的平面：{rejections}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate implies a vertical separation of {separation:.2f} m, which the {distance:.2f} m straight-line distance cannot contain"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射意味着垂直间距为 {separation:.2f} m，而 {distance:.2f} m 的直线距离容纳不下这一间距"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate has no real solution for a plane above both devices"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射对于两台设备上方的平面没有实数解"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate implies an upper plane {height:.2f} m above the lower one ({low:.1f}-{high:.1f} m is treated as plausible)"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射意味着上方平面比下方平面高 {height:.2f} m（合理范围为 {low:.1f}-{high:.1f} m）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate implies an upper plane {height:.2f} m up, less than {clearance:.2f} m above the higher of the two devices"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射意味着上方平面高 {height:.2f} m，比两台设备中较高者高出不到 {clearance:.2f} m"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no detected reflection can be read as a plane above both devices; even the lowest plausible upper plane ({lowest:.1f} m) would arrive at about {delay:.1f} ms, beyond the {start:.1f}-{end:.1f} ms window that could be searched, so absence here is not evidence of absence"
msgstr "检测到的反射均无法解读为位于两台设备上方的平面；即使是最低的合理上方平面（{lowest:.1f} m），其反射也约在 {delay:.1f} ms 才到达，超出了可搜索的 {start:.1f}-{end:.1f} ms 窗口，因此此处没有找到并不代表不存在"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no detected reflection can be read as a plane above both devices"
msgstr "检测到的反射均无法解读为位于两台设备上方的平面"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {delay:.1f} ms candidate implies the loudspeaker is vertically above the microphone, which leaves no horizontal separation"
msgstr "{delay:.1f} ms 处的候选反射意味着扬声器位于话筒正上方，两者之间没有水平间距"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no separate arrival from a plane above the devices was found, and one as low as {lowest:.2f} m would arrive at {earliest:.1f} ms -- within the {resolution:.1f} ms the reflection search can resolve from the {used:.1f} ms arrival this height was solved from. That arrival may therefore be two arrivals merged into one peak, which would bias the height. Moving the microphone 20-30 cm up or down and measuring again separates them"
msgstr "未找到来自设备上方平面的独立到达声，而低至 {lowest:.2f} m 的平面，其反射会在 {earliest:.1f} ms 到达——与求解该高度所用的 {used:.1f} ms 到达声相距不超过反射搜索的分辨能力 {resolution:.1f} ms。因此该到达声可能是合并为一个峰的两次到达，这会使高度产生偏差。将话筒上移或下移 20-30 cm 后重新测量即可将两者分开"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the quiet segment is too short for the {bands} band filter(s); no level is reported for them"
msgstr "安静段太短，不足以用于 {bands} 频带滤波器；这些频带不报告电平"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "No quiet segment found: add at least 1 s of silence before the sweep (the generated test signal already contains it) or record a longer tail."
msgstr "未找到安静段：请在扫频前加入至少 1 s 的静音（生成的测试信号已包含），或录制更长的尾部。"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the quiet segment is below {floor:g} dBFS ({level:.0f} dBFS): that is below the quantisation noise of a 24-bit file, so it is digital silence or numerical residue, not a measured noise floor"
msgstr "安静段低于 {floor:g} dBFS（{level:.0f} dBFS）：这低于 24 位文件的量化噪声，因此是数字静音或数值残留，而不是实测的本底噪声"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "quiet segment is too short ({duration:.2f} s) for mains-hum detection"
msgstr "安静段太短（{duration:.2f} s），无法检测电源嗡声"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "quiet segment taken from the end of the recording; it may contain late reverberation, so the noise floor may be overestimated"
msgstr "安静段取自录音末尾；其中可能含有后期混响，因此本底噪声可能被高估"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{dropped:.2f} s of exact digital zeros (an export that starts before the recorded region, or a gap between regions) were excluded from the pre-sweep segment"
msgstr "扫频前片段中有 {dropped:.2f} s 精确为零的数字静音已被排除（导出范围从录音区域之前开始，或区域之间有空隙）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{dropped:.2f} s of exact digital zeros (an export that starts before the recorded region, or a gap between regions) were excluded from the tail segment"
msgstr "末尾片段中有 {dropped:.2f} s 精确为零的数字静音已被排除（导出范围从录音区域之前开始，或区域之间有空隙）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{dropped:.2f} s of exact digital zeros (an export that starts before the recorded region, or a gap between regions) were excluded from the {source} segment"
msgstr "{source} 片段中有 {dropped:.2f} s 精确为零的数字静音已被排除（导出范围从录音区域之前开始，或区域之间有空隙）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only {remaining:.2f} s of the pre-sweep segment are not digital silence, less than the {needed:.2f} s a level needs"
msgstr "扫频前片段中只有 {remaining:.2f} s 不是数字静音，少于测量电平所需的 {needed:.2f} s"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only {remaining:.2f} s of the tail segment are not digital silence, less than the {needed:.2f} s a level needs"
msgstr "末尾片段中只有 {remaining:.2f} s 不是数字静音，少于测量电平所需的 {needed:.2f} s"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only {remaining:.2f} s of the {source} segment are not digital silence, less than the {needed:.2f} s a level needs"
msgstr "{source} 片段中只有 {remaining:.2f} s 不是数字静音，少于测量电平所需的 {needed:.2f} s"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only {usable:.2f} s of the pre-sweep segment are usable instead of the {configured:.2f} s configured; the levels come from that shorter part"
msgstr "扫频前片段中只有 {usable:.2f} s 可用，而不是设定的 {configured:.2f} s；电平来自这段较短的部分"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only {usable:.2f} s of the tail segment are usable instead of the {configured:.2f} s configured; the levels come from that shorter part"
msgstr "末尾片段中只有 {usable:.2f} s 可用，而不是设定的 {configured:.2f} s；电平来自这段较短的部分"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "only {usable:.2f} s of the {source} segment are usable instead of the {configured:.2f} s configured; the levels come from that shorter part"
msgstr "{source} 片段中只有 {usable:.2f} s 可用，而不是设定的 {configured:.2f} s；电平来自这段较短的部分"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the pre-sweep segment is only {below:.1f} dB below the level of the sweep ({sweep:.1f} dBFS RMS): it is not background noise (a sweep pass without silence before it?)"
msgstr "扫频前片段仅比扫频电平（{sweep:.1f} dBFS RMS）低 {below:.1f} dB：它不是本底噪声（扫频前没有留出静音？）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the tail segment is only {below:.1f} dB below the level of the sweep ({sweep:.1f} dBFS RMS): it is not background noise (a sweep pass without silence before it?)"
msgstr "末尾片段仅比扫频电平（{sweep:.1f} dBFS RMS）低 {below:.1f} dB：它不是本底噪声（扫频前没有留出静音？）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {source} segment is only {below:.1f} dB below the level of the sweep ({sweep:.1f} dBFS RMS): it is not background noise (a sweep pass without silence before it?)"
msgstr "{source} 片段仅比扫频电平（{sweep:.1f} dBFS RMS）低 {below:.1f} dB：它不是本底噪声（扫频前没有留出静音？）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the pre-sweep segment is digital silence (exact zeros); the acoustic noise floor cannot be measured there"
msgstr "扫频前片段是数字静音（精确为零）；无法在此测量声学本底噪声"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the tail segment is digital silence (exact zeros); the acoustic noise floor cannot be measured there"
msgstr "末尾片段是数字静音（精确为零）；无法在此测量声学本底噪声"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {source} segment is digital silence (exact zeros); the acoustic noise floor cannot be measured there"
msgstr "{source} 片段是数字静音（精确为零）；无法在此测量声学本底噪声"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the pre-sweep segment is not quiet: only {quiet:.2f} s of it stay within {excess:.0f} dB of its quietest blocks (another sweep pass or a noise event?)"
msgstr "扫频前片段不够安静：其中只有 {quiet:.2f} s 保持在最安静块的 {excess:.0f} dB 以内（另一遍扫频，还是噪声事件？）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the tail segment is not quiet: only {quiet:.2f} s of it stay within {excess:.0f} dB of its quietest blocks (another sweep pass or a noise event?)"
msgstr "末尾片段不够安静：其中只有 {quiet:.2f} s 保持在最安静块的 {excess:.0f} dB 以内（另一遍扫频，还是噪声事件？）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {source} segment is not quiet: only {quiet:.2f} s of it stay within {excess:.0f} dB of its quietest blocks (another sweep pass or a noise event?)"
msgstr "{source} 片段不够安静：其中只有 {quiet:.2f} s 保持在最安静块的 {excess:.0f} dB 以内（另一遍扫频，还是噪声事件？）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{excluded:.2f} s of the pre-sweep segment were more than {excess:.0f} dB above its quietest blocks (another sweep pass or a noise event?) and were excluded"
msgstr "扫频前片段中有 {excluded:.2f} s 比其最安静的块高出 {excess:.0f} dB 以上（另一遍扫频，还是噪声事件？），已被排除"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{excluded:.2f} s of the tail segment were more than {excess:.0f} dB above its quietest blocks (another sweep pass or a noise event?) and were excluded"
msgstr "末尾片段中有 {excluded:.2f} s 比其最安静的块高出 {excess:.0f} dB 以上（另一遍扫频，还是噪声事件？），已被排除"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{excluded:.2f} s of the {source} segment were more than {excess:.0f} dB above its quietest blocks (another sweep pass or a noise event?) and were excluded"
msgstr "{source} 片段中有 {excluded:.2f} s 比其最安静的块高出 {excess:.0f} dB 以上（另一遍扫频，还是噪声事件？），已被排除"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "harmonics of {base:.0f} Hz were found as well, but {best:.0f} Hz explains more of them; a single mains supply has one fundamental"
msgstr "也发现了 {base:.0f} Hz 的谐波，但 {best:.0f} Hz 能解释更多谐波；同一市电只有一个基频"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {band} band ({band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz) is not fully inside the excitation range ({low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz, {source}): it contains only leakage and noise, so no decay values are reported"
msgstr "{band} 频带（{band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz）未完全位于激励范围（{low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz，{source}）内：其中只有泄漏和噪声，因此不报告衰减值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the Lundeby noise-floor iteration did not converge in {iterations} iteration(s)"
msgstr "Lundeby 本底噪声迭代在 {iterations} 次迭代内未收敛"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the decay curve drops {step:.1f} dB across the direct sound (it carries {share:.0f} % of the energy; limit {limit:g} dB): EDT describes the direct sound rather than the room at this position"
msgstr "衰减曲线在直达声处下降了 {step:.1f} dB（直达声占能量的 {share:.0f} %；上限 {limit:g} dB）：EDT 描述的是直达声，而不是该位置的房间"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the decay curve is not straight (curvature C = {curvature:.0f} %, limit {limit:.0f} %): possibly a double slope, coupled volumes or strong early reflections; no single reverberation time describes it"
msgstr "衰减曲线不是直线（曲率 C = {curvature:.0f} %，上限 {limit:.0f} %）：可能是双斜率衰减、耦合空间或强烈的早期反射；无法用单一混响时间描述"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {band} band ({band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz) is not fully inside the excitation range ({low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz, sweep settings): it contains only leakage and noise, so no decay values are reported"
msgstr "{band} 频带（{band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz）未完全位于激励范围（{low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz，扫频设置）内：其中只有泄漏和噪声，因此不报告衰减值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {band} band ({band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz) is not fully inside the excitation range ({low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz, estimated from reference audio): it contains only leakage and noise, so no decay values are reported"
msgstr "{band} 频带（{band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz）未完全位于激励范围（{low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz，由参考音频估算）内：其中只有泄漏和噪声，因此不报告衰减值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {band} band ({band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz) is not fully inside the excitation range ({low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz, declared by the user): it contains only leakage and noise, so no decay values are reported"
msgstr "{band} 频带（{band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz）未完全位于激励范围（{low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz，用户声明）内：其中只有泄漏和噪声，因此不报告衰减值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {band} band ({band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz) is not fully inside the excitation range ({low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz, unknown): it contains only leakage and noise, so no decay values are reported"
msgstr "{band} 频带（{band_low:.0f}-{band_high:.0f} Hz）未完全位于激励范围（{low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz，未知）内：其中只有泄漏和噪声，因此不报告衰减值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the late decay slope ({late:.1f} dB/s) is less than {ratio:g} times the early slope ({early:.1f} dB/s)"
msgstr "后期衰减斜率（{late:.1f} dB/s）小于早期斜率（{early:.1f} dB/s）的 {ratio:g} 倍"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the {metric} fit is not straight (xi = {xi:.0f} permille, limit {limit:.0f}): {metric} is not a reliable reverberation time here"
msgstr "{metric} 拟合不是直线（xi = {xi:.0f} ‰，上限 {limit:.0f}）：此处 {metric} 不是可靠的混响时间"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the noise truncation is not trustworthy ({problem}) and the result depends on it ({changes})"
msgstr "噪声截断不可信（{problem}），而结果依赖于它（{changes}）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "decay analysis: the {bands} band(s) are not fully inside the excitation range ({low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz); no decay values are reported for them"
msgstr "衰减分析：{bands} 频带未完全位于激励范围（{low:.0f}-{high:.0f} Hz）内；这些频带不报告衰减值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the response is too short for a noise-floor estimate"
msgstr "响应太短，无法估计本底噪声"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "no decay above the noise floor was found"
msgstr "在本底噪声之上未发现衰减"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the response does not decay"
msgstr "响应没有衰减"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Insufficient decay range: {available:.1f} dB available, {needed:.0f} dB needed ({range:.0f} dB range + {margin:.0f} dB above noise)"
msgstr "衰减范围不足：可用 {available:.1f} dB，需要 {needed:.0f} dB（{range:.0f} dB 评估范围 + 高于噪声 {margin:.0f} dB）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Insufficient decay range: the decay curve does not reach the evaluation range"
msgstr "衰减范围不足：衰减曲线未达到评估范围"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Decay slope is not negative"
msgstr "衰减斜率不为负"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {seconds:.2f} s vs no value"
msgstr "{metric} {seconds:.2f} s，对比无值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} has no truncation-independent value"
msgstr "{metric} 没有不受截断影响的值"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "B*T = {bt:.1f} < {minimum:g}: the band filter's own decay is comparable to the measured decay; values in this band are unreliable"
msgstr "B*T = {bt:.1f} < {minimum:g}: 频带滤波器自身的衰减与实测衰减相当；此频带的数值不可靠"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the noise crosspoint ({crosspoint:.2f} s after the onset) lies far beyond the first point where the decay reaches the noise floor ({reached:.2f} s)"
msgstr "噪声交叉点（起始后 {crosspoint:.2f} s）远远晚于衰减首次达到本底噪声的时刻（{reached:.2f} s）"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Evaluation range covers fewer than 3 samples after the direct sound"
msgstr "评估范围在直达声之后覆盖的样本少于 3 个"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Evaluation range covers fewer than 3 samples"
msgstr "评估范围覆盖的样本少于 3 个"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {seconds:.2f} s vs {other:.2f} s"
msgstr "{metric} {seconds:.2f} s，对比 {other:.2f} s"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "decay analysis, broadband: {warning}"
msgstr "衰减分析，宽带：{warning}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "decay analysis, {band}: {warning}"
msgstr "衰减分析，{band}：{warning}"

