msgid "<b>RoomScope {version}</b><br>An open-source, DAW-independent recording environment analyzer.<br><br>Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.<br>This program uses Qt and PySide6 (Copyright The Qt Company Ltd. and contributors) under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3; the Qt libraries are loaded as separate shared libraries and may be replaced by interface-compatible versions. NumPy, SciPy, matplotlib, soundfile (libsndfile, LGPL-2.1) and sounddevice (PortAudio) are used under their respective licenses.<br><br>A desktop bundle ships a <code>THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/</code> directory next to the executable (and inside <code>RoomScope.app</code> on macOS). From a source checkout see docs/DEPENDENCIES.md. Levels are digital (dBFS) unless a calibration is provided; RoomScope never reports dB SPL."
msgstr "<b>RoomScope {version}</b><br>开源、不依赖 DAW 的录音环境分析器。<br><br>采用 Apache 许可证 2.0。<br>本程序使用 Qt 与 PySide6（版权归 Qt 公司及其贡献者所有），遵循 GNU LGPL 第 3 版；Qt 库以独立共享库加载，可以替换为接口兼容的版本。NumPy、SciPy、matplotlib、soundfile（libsndfile，LGPL-2.1）和 sounddevice（PortAudio）按其各自的许可证使用。<br><br>桌面安装包在可执行文件旁边附带 <code>THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/</code> 目录（在 macOS 上则位于 <code>RoomScope.app</code> 内）。从源码目录查看 docs/DEPENDENCIES.md。电平是数字电平（dBFS），除非提供了校准；RoomScope 从不报告 dB SPL。"

msgid "Nothing has been entered. This picture shows where the two tape measures go. It is not your room, and no wall is drawn."
