msgid "The line is the loudspeaker distance you entered, and the stand is the microphone height you entered. The loudspeaker is drawn at that same height only so the tape can be seen; its real height comes from a measurement. No room and no wall are drawn."
msgstr "这条线是你填入的扬声器距离，立杆是你填入的话筒高度。扬声器画在同一高度，只是为了看见这根卷尺；它的真实高度要等测量之后才知道。没有画房间，也没有画墙。"

