msgid "ratios from the same truncation as the decay; not a room score"
msgstr "与衰减使用同一次噪声截断的比值；不是房间评分"

msgid "C50 is early energy over late energy at 50 ms (speech). C80 is the same at 80 ms (music). D50 is the share of energy in the first 50 ms. Centre time is the energy-weighted average time. Time zero is the detected direct sound. A ratio is reported only when the decay range is at least 20 dB, and it is not a room score."
msgstr "C50 是 50 ms 处的早期能量除以后期能量（语言）。C80 是 80 ms 处的同一比值（音乐）。D50 是前 50 ms 能量占总能量的份额。重心时间是按能量加权的平均时间。时间零点是测得的直达声。只有衰减范围至少有 20 dB 时才给出比值，而且它不是房间评分。"

msgid "Centre time"
msgstr "重心时间"

msgid "EARLY AND LATE ENERGY"
msgstr "早期与后期能量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "Insufficient decay range for an early/late energy ratio: {available:.1f} dB available, {needed:.0f} dB needed"
msgstr "早期/后期能量比的衰减范围不够：现有 {available:.1f} dB，需要 {needed:.0f} dB"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the noise truncation ({truncation_s:.3f} s) is not after the {split_ms:.0f} ms early window, so the late energy is not measured"
msgstr "噪声截断点（{truncation_s:.3f} s）不在 {split_ms:.0f} ms 早期窗之后，因此没有测到后期能量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {value:.1f} dB vs {other:.1f} dB"
msgstr "{metric} {value:.1f} dB，对比 {other:.1f} dB"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the response is too short for a centre time"
msgstr "响应太短，无法计算重心时间"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {value:.1f} % vs {other:.1f} %"
msgstr "{metric} {value:.1f} %，对比 {other:.1f} %"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {seconds:.3f} s vs {other:.3f} s"
msgstr "{metric} {seconds:.3f} s，对比 {other:.3f} s"

msgid "Early sound is not clearly ahead of the later room sound (C50 {value:.1f} dB, below {threshold:.0f} dB). For close-miked recording this can blur the source; move the microphone closer or add absorption, then measure again. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "早期声没有明显压过后面的房间声（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低于 {threshold:.0f} dB）。近距离拾音时声源可能发糊；把话筒移近，或增加吸声后再测一次。这是一个位置的结果，不是房间评分。"

msgid "Late room sound is weak (C80 {value:.1f} dB, above {threshold:.0f} dB). This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "后期房间声偏少（C80 {value:.1f} dB，高于 {threshold:.0f} dB）。这是一个位置的结果，不是房间评分。"

msgid "Speech clarity is low for close vocals (C50 {value:.1f} dB, below {threshold:.0f} dB). Diction may blur between words; move the microphone closer or add absorption. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "对人声近距离拾音来说，语言清晰度偏低（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低于 {threshold:.0f} dB）。字与字之间可能发糊；把话筒移近，或增加吸声。这是一个位置的结果，不是房间评分。"

msgid "Speech clarity is low for voice-over (C50 {value:.1f} dB, below {threshold:.0f} dB). Narration usually wants the first 50 ms to hold more of the energy; move the microphone closer or add absorption. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "对旁白来说，语言清晰度偏低（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低于 {threshold:.0f} dB）。旁白通常希望前 50 毫秒占更多能量；把话筒移近，或增加吸声。这是一个位置的结果，不是房间评分。"

msgid "Musical clarity is low for acoustic guitar (C80 {value:.1f} dB, below {threshold:.0f} dB). The note may sit in the room rather than in the instrument; move the microphone closer or add absorption. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "对原声吉他来说，音乐清晰度偏低（C80 {value:.1f} dB，低于 {threshold:.0f} dB）。音符可能落在房间里而不是乐器上；把话筒移近，或增加吸声。这是一个位置的结果，不是房间评分。"

msgid "Late room sound is weak for a room microphone (C80 {value:.1f} dB, above {threshold:.0f} dB). A room microphone usually wants more of the room after 80 ms; move it farther from the source or into a livelier part of the room. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "作为房间话筒，后期房间声偏少（C80 {value:.1f} dB，高于 {threshold:.0f} dB）。房间话筒通常希望 80 毫秒之后还有更多房间声；把话筒移离声源，或换到更活的位置。这是一个位置的结果，不是房间评分。"

msgid "Speech clarity is low for an ensemble (C50 {value:.1f} dB, below {threshold:.0f} dB). Some late sound suits a choir, but this much will blur diction. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "对合唱来说，语言清晰度偏低（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低于 {threshold:.0f} dB）。合奏可以保留一些后期声，但到这个程度吐字会糊。这是一个位置的结果，不是房间评分。"

